msgstr "已解析物件在執行目標 '{target}' 時沒有可呼叫屬性 '{segment}'"

msgid "Run a Moldflow target with named parameters or JSON input. Bare targets are treated as synergy.<target>."
msgstr "使用具名參數或 JSON 輸入執行 Moldflow 目標。未加前綴的目標會視為 synergy.<target>。"

msgid "Save Error"
msgstr "儲存錯誤"

